{
  "corpusVersion": 1,
  "description": "Synthetic guideline and template fixtures for Phase 9 (§139, §140). Every passage here was invented for this file. No institution's real guidelines are committed to this repository and none are ever sent anywhere in CI (§149). The cases exercise the classification PalCert must get right — what is a requirement, what is merely observed, what is ambiguous, what conflicts, and what PalCert cannot represent — rather than any particular model's prose.",
